4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dvkHAqGEWNsQ7kNvwHC2JC5&_nc_oc=AdqG7W3PjiA_BbfgZqJk2HtRzfwgyuk0GG5kUc4Niuck7NORyXjAlA5WVdXgZon-jx8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6DtA6JJlRZCqloh68NMVq3Hc7n3tMfkjZd3MNXFvEdg&oe=6A9AC1D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ft_sSJfn65oQ7kNvwEW1d1D&_nc_oc=Adopxi-4EcQGRMsiaFABkAnRWV1xV4CZjMQPfDGAxgNIUG7-rqp4AsipJZxfI0jifv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ-XLSkjqCebg5BV625WoyGYNlZ4Vhvs_dP9NOEmGVXFA&oe=6A9AC6B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7jNeBCq5iTsQ7kNvwGHGilR&_nc_oc=Adq_gbgHGM6Mv_p4HuzgH-_s2dgjqG5JdCWPmSnmhE7uaZ97UxpN0H6ooTSC_Ewx534&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJHKVE4hxv36oQggKkSTtFUO4P1XkvrFZXndTXaHHzgGw&oe=6A9AD455"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p